# Source for the hash-locked prod requirements (requirements-prod.lock).
# Combines runtime deps (setup.py install_requires reads requirements.py3.txt)
# with prod server deps. VCS theme deps (git+ssh) are stripped post-compile —
# pip cannot hash a git repo; themes install via 'pip install .' (SHA-pinned by
# their own repos). Regenerate with: make pins-lock
-r requirements.py3.txt
-r requirements-prod.txt
